title: TigerDialogue
---
This is an example of a Yarn Spinner script. Write your dialogue here!
===
title: LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase="">>
<<declare $hasVisited = false>>
<<SetPhase TigerNPC>>
//the npc gameobject.name called in the set phase command should map to the specific npc you want to reference
//for instance if you have particualr gameobject npc you want this to call from make sure you use that gameobject name
<<if $dialoguePhase == "begin">>
<<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "comeback">>
<<jump comeback>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questStarted">>
<<jump questStarted>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questCompleted">>
<<jump questCompleted>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "rewardGiven">>
<<jump rewardGiven>>
<<else>>
Tiger: dude you suck, fix ur code.
<<endif>>
===
title: variables
---
<<declare $money = 10>>
<<declare $lost = false>>
<<declare $insane = false>>
===
title: Start
position: 241,1
---
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "npc">>
<<set $hasVisited = true>>
Tiger: Oh, thank god!
Tiger: Someone at last!
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "pc">>
You: Hey you okay?
<<jump Inquiry>>
===
title: Inquiry
position: 285,274
---
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "npc">>
Tiger: No, not really!
Tiger: My house!
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "pc">>
You: What's wrong with your house?
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "npc">>
Tiger: RATS!!!
Tiger: LOTS and LOTS of RATS!!!!
Tiger: They are swarming my house!!!
<<jump Beg>>
===
title: Beg
position: 609,406
---
Tiger: Please help me!
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "pc">>
You: NOOOO!!
You: I am scared of rats too!
You: No way in hell!
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "npc">>
Tiger: ...
Tiger: Look I will even sell you my beloved gloves so you can catch them.
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "pc">>
You: ...
You: You want my help AND I have to pay you??
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "npc">>
Tiger: Have you seen the current state of economy?
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "pc">>
You: Okay fair.
You: How much?
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "pc">>
Tiger: Tell you what, I will give you the house if you become my maid for a week.
    ->What? No way weirdo. 
        <<GetPhase TigerNPC comeback>>
        <<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "return">>
    ->. . . Fine...
        <<GetPhase TigerNPC questStarted>>
        <<jump questStarted>>
===
title: comeback
---
Tiger: Changed your mind?
    ->No.
        You: Still not that desperate. 
        <<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "return">>
    ->. . . Fine...
        <<GetPhase TigerNPC questStarted>>
        <<jump questStarted>>
===
title: questStarted
---
<<once>>
Tiger: Lovely!
Tiger: So your chores are: . . .
Tiger: Go talk to the boxes.
You: . . .
You: What?
Tiger: ?
You: You know what, I don't even want to know.
<<endonce>>
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "return">>
===
title: questCompleted
---
<<if $hasVisited == true>>
    Tiger: Good job!
    Tiger: House is yours!
<<else>>
    Tiger: Are you talking to my boxes without permission?
    You: . . . Sorry...
    Tiger: It is ok, lol.
    Tiger: House is yours now btw. Congrats!
<<endif>>
<<GetPhase TigerNPC rewardGiven>>
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "return">>
===
title: rewardGiven
---
<<declare $reply = random_range(1, 2)>>
<<if $reply == 1>>
    Tiger: I am just packing and I will be out of your hair!
<<elseif $reply == 2>>
    Tiger: I am leaving! I am leaving!
<<endif>>
<<CamMove TigerNPCCamRig "return">>
===